    {
      "_type": "quoteSection",
      "_key": "wed-quote",
      "quote": "Looking back at our wedding, we are very thankful to have chosen First Baptist Muncie for our ceremony and to have had the pleasure to work with their staff. The care and help we received was genuine and thorough and the beauty of the building is unparalleled. Mrs. Lemen was always very quick to answer any questions and help with any accommodations. When it is all said and done, they celebrate the gift of marriage with you like family.",
      "attribution": "Hanna and Nathan"
    },
